Package: BESTish
Type: Package
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-01-06
Title: Inference of mutation and selection rates from time-series and cohort mutant VAFs
Authors@R: c(
    person("Khanh", "Dinh", email = "knd2127@columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Keito", "Taketomi", email = "kt2849@columbia.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Ren-Yi", "Wang", email = "rw3170@columbia.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Grid-based Bayesian inference methods to infer mutation rates and selection
    coefficients from variant allele frequency (VAF) data of specific mutations
    in longitudinal and population-level studies.
    Mathematically derived closed-form likelihoods are implemented to enhance accuracy and efficiency.
